
# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>          at most 72 characters, no period at the end
#
# Types:  feat  fix  perf  revert  docs  style  refactor  test  build  ci  chore
# A "!" after the type (or scope) marks a breaking change:  feat!: change the settings file
#
# What the next release does:
#   feat = minor    fix, perf = patch    "!" or BREAKING CHANGE = major (minor while below 1.0)
#   docs, test, refactor, style, build, ci, chore = no release by themselves
#
# Body (optional): what changed and why, wrapped at about 72 characters.
#
# Footers (optional):
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to adapt
#   Release-As: 1.0.0
